# A Minstrel in Despair (jeuno 12): Mertaire, Bki Tbujhja and Mataligeat in Lower Jeuno, the Song Runes of Buburimu
# Peninsula. The Old Monument completed (never begun): Bki's 182, Mataligeat's 144, Mertaire's
# MERTAIRE_MALLIEBELL_LEFT (messageName(..., true, false): showName, no turn), a sheet to Bki and Mataligeat while
# offered (no trade handler: nil), a trade without the Poetic Parchment (nil), the runes' failsafe (SONG_RUNES_REQUIRE; two sheets: nil; one sheet: 2, the sheet taken, a new Poetic
# Parchment, SONG_RUNES_WRITING), then the parchment with a sheet to Mertaire (tradeHas, not exact: 101; completed,
# 2100 gil, fame +7 x3, only the parchment taken). Completed: Path of the Bard's Mertaire (COULD_HE_BE).
lists LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Mertaire/onTrade LowerJeuno/Bki_Tbujhja/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Bki_Tbujhja/onTrade LowerJeuno/Mataligeat/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Mataligeat/onTrade BuburimuPeninsula/Song_Runes/onTrigger BuburimuPeninsula/Song_Runes/onTrade BuburimuPeninsula/onEventFinish/2 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/101
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-19.5,0,-59 job=WAR lvl=30
quest Jeuno.TheOldMonument completed
item SheetOfParchment x3
login
trigger Bki_Tbujhja                         # available: 182
finish
trade Bki_Tbujhja SheetOfParchment x1       # available: no trade handler, nil
trigger Mataligeat                          # 144
finish
trade Mataligeat SheetOfParchment x1        # available: no trade handler, nil
trigger Mertaire                            # MERTAIRE_MALLIEBELL_LEFT (showName, no turn)
trade Mertaire SheetOfParchment x1          # no Poetic Parchment: nil; nothing
warp -244,16,-280 BuburimuPeninsula
trigger Song_Runes                          # SONG_RUNES_REQUIRE
trade Song_Runes SheetOfParchment x2        # not exactly one sheet: nil
trade Song_Runes SheetOfParchment x1        # cutscene 2
finish                                      # the sheet taken, a Poetic Parchment, SONG_RUNES_WRITING
warp -19.5,0,-59 LowerJeuno
trade Mertaire PoeticParchment x1 SheetOfParchment x1  # holds the parchment (not exact): 101
finish                                      # completed: 2100 gil, fame +7 x3; the parchment taken, the sheet handed back
trigger Mertaire                            # completed: Path of the Bard's COULD_HE_BE
